<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: GOLF-IRISH OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-IRISH OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the third</p>
<p>round of the Irish Open golf tournament on Saturday (British</p>
<p>unless stated):</p>
<p>PA SPORT GOLF Irish Final Collated  = 1 Collated third-round</p>
<p>scores and totals in the 700,000 Murphy's Irish Open at Druids</p>
<p>Glen, County Wicklow (Gbr and Irl unless stated):</p>
<p>204 Lee Westwood 65 69 70</p>
<p>207 Colin Montgomerie 68 70 69</p>
<p>209 Dave Tapping 72 68 69</p>
<p>210 Jose Maria Olazabal (Spain) 74 71 65, Barry Lane 73 71 66,</p>
<p>Nick Faldo 69 73 68, Eamonn Darcy (Ireland)  70 71 69,</p>
<p>Wayne Westner (South Africa) 70 70 70, Thomas Bjorn</p>
<p>(Denmark) 66 70 74</p>
<p>211 Ian Woosnam 71 70 70, Daniel Chopra (Sweden) 71 69 71,</p>
<p>Michael Jonzon (Sweden) 72 64 75</p>
<p>212 Phillip Price 70 73 69, Roger Chapman 69 73 70</p>
<p>213 Peter Hedblom (Sweden) 72 73 68, Daren Lee 71 73 69,</p>
<p>Gordon Brand Jnr 73 70 70, Mark Roe 71 73 69,</p>
<p>Tony Johnstone (Zimbabwe) 73 70 70, Robert Allenby</p>
<p>(Australia) 68 72 73</p>
<p>214 Sam Torrance 71 73 70, Padraig Harrington (Ireland)</p>
<p>71 72 71, Rolf Muntz (Netherlands) 70 73 71, Klas Eriksson</p>
<p>(Sweden) 71 71 72, Steven Richardson 67 75 72,</p>
<p>Katsuyoshi Tomori (Japan) 72 69 73</p>
